Subject: CPMS I03E3 Proof Oracle and Review Protocol
Description: Canonical formation for independent expectation, claim, coverage, faculty cross-review, dissent, trust, and Observer candidate-formation evidence over exact I03E2 proposals. It separates integrity digests, attestations, digital signatures, review completion, and execution authority.

